id: sl_main_custom_main
label: SL Main custom main provides
package: platform_core
description: >
  Component to be required by a component (.slcc) or project (.slcp) file if this project provides a custom function main() to be used instead of the main() function provided by the component sl_main for baremetal or RTOS.
  If the project has a custom main() and sl_main_custom_main is forgotten, it will lead to a compiler
  error about duplicate definitions of "main" symbol.
category: Runtime|Test
quality: production
metadata:
  sbom:
    license: Zlib
provides:
- name: sl_main_custom_main
- name: custom_main
template_contribution:
- name: component_catalog
  value: custom_main
root_path: platform_core
